### 환경 변수 설정
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8089
@userId = d5a2c91b-6c8a-4f1c-9e2e-4a3f5f2e8c99
@username = 테스트유저
@role = USER

### 세션 생성 - 성공
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/session
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Name: {{username}}
X-User-Role: {{role}}
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

{
  "organizationId": "374569af-ac46-46a2-bd97-cc10dbbec4e4",
  "publisher": "{{userId}}",
  "title": "스파르타 세션23",
  "totalCount": 15,
  "status": "READY",
  "openTime": "2025-04-13T10:00:00",
  "closeTime": "2025-06-20T12:00:00",
   "applyInfo": {
   "reason": "hello"
  }
}

### 세션 조회 - 성공
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/session/f8a51985-df04-4184-866a-2f0f34e3c35a
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Name: {{username}}
X-User-Role: {{role}}
X-User-ID: {{userId}}


### 세션 검색 - 성공
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/session
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Name: {{username}}
X-User-Role: {{role}}
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### 세션 수정 - 성공
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/session/b2ae29d4-ad9f-4f24-929a-11f6cf880dbc
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "변경된 타이틀",
  "count": 20
}
### 세션 상태 수정 - 성공
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/session/12f4c20e-7fe6-44e2-9793-9e49c3c3f267/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Name: {{username}}
X-User-Role: {{role}}
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

{
  "status": "CLOSED"
}


### 세션 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8089/api/v1/session/e9c40764-5f82-45eb-b0e7-911fc775c51c
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Name: {{username}}
X-User-Role: {{role}}
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### 세션 승인
PATCH http://localhost:8089/api/v1/session/fa787bd6-05c8-4514-b332-ec77ecf2fa82/apply
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Name: {{username}}
X-User-Role: {{role}}
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### 세션에 참가한 맴버 조회 (내부용)
GET http://localhost:8089/internal/v1/session/f8a51985-df04-4184-866a-2f0f34e3c35a

### 세션 참가
POST http://localhost:8089/api/v1/session/fa787bd6-05c8-4514-b332-ec77ecf2fa82/join
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Name: test3
X-User-Role: {{role}}
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### 세션 나가기
DELETE http://localhost:8089/api/v1/session/f8a51985-df04-4184-866a-2f0f34e3c35a/leave
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Name: test3
X-User-Role: {{role}}
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### 세션 강퇴
DELETE http://localhost:8089/api/v1/session/62c6cacc-86a3-4c77-87ba-a1648bcd770e/remove
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Name: test2
X-User-Role: {{role}}
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

{
  "members": ["test3"]
}
